Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.15,0:00:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不惧怕十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross won't repel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阳光奈何他们不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunlight won't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但嗜血是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloodlust, that part's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他喂给你的是吸血鬼的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was vampire blood he dosed you with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得光线很强  照的你皮肤难受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights are too bright? Sunshine hurt your skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你一声  报警电话一按就接通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, 911's on speed-dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利希  你可以相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy, you can trust me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸出门了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your dad's on the road right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.47,0:00:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一阵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been gone a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸走了  就没再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad left, and he didn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也要一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-门都没有  -我去定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Hell, no. - I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个服务员为什么要上卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that waitress getting into that truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赖嘛  顶个拳嘛  干得漂亮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on. Give it up. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑住  我来了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on -- I got you! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他帮不了你  没人能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't help you. No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我只能自己来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll have to help myself, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm retiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这真傻啊  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're so lame. - Yeah, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(堪萨斯  康威泉)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿只有我们  克利希\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one out here but us, Krissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  别丢下我啊  艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Don't leave me here! Aidan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真悬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次你来做诱饵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time one of you can be the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了一个  还有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One down. Two to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we looking at again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高速公路边发现两具年轻女子尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Two young women found near the freeway
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,且遭人割喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}with their throats ripped out."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看像是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds vampy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这个案子你不想参与了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you want to take a knee on this one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你觉得有点力不从...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're not feeling up to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是测试的事  还有小卡的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the trials, what Cass said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的伤他也不能治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you got what he can't cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, which means what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道啊  你说呢  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know. You tell me. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  小卡把你伤得不轻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Um, Cass dinged you up pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想确保你还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just wanted to make sure you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指感情上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like my feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想谈谈这个  好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you want to talk about, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去买点草药茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I go get some, uh, herbal tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-懒得理你  -你去找几个瘾君子牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - And you can find some cowboy junkies on the dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就把这事好好聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? We'll just talk it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈话愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是相当愉快  很健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nay, great talk! Very healthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是为"少女杀手"的案子而来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here about the lady killer murders, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"少女杀手"\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lady killer murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我自己想的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, coined it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜  能跟我们谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. What can you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个死者都是21岁以下的女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, both victims were female, under 21,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}and here's the kicker --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们的血都被吸干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were drained of all their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们也觉得很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. We found that strange, also.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但昨晚  情况变得更怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then last night, things got even stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-昨晚  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last night? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出于安全考虑  我们在富勒角安了摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We set up a security cam on Fuller's point for safety purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当地的年轻人都去那儿亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where our local young people like to go make out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚  发生了疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, things got crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是吓人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a thing, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:30.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能认出他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you I.D. any of these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赶到时犯罪现场已经清理一空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crime scene was empty when we got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者也不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No vic, no nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得是邪教或是毒品什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm thinking it's some kind of cult or a drug thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我一小时前对这三个人发了全州通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I put a statewide A.P.B. Out on these three about an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得取消通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need you to call that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些带子也得交给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna need this footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警长  你以为我们为什么会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, why do you think we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这里牵扯到联邦调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just crossed streams with a federal investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你还是配合一下  取消全境通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I suggest you cooperate, call off your A.P.B.,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你就吃不了兜着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're gonna find yourself in a world of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是唱的哪一出啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was that all about, g-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得克利希·钱伯斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Krissy Chambers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得  那起尸鬼的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, the Vetalas case, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在高速公路的货车停车场下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were working that truck stop by the freeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和她父亲帮我们了结了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and her dad helped us shut 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  然后她保证会回归平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, and then he promised to go civilian
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将来不会做个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she wouldn't grow up to be a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜这部虐杀电影的主角是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guess who the star of this snuff film is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他不知道她在干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe he doesn't know she's doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大半夜的溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, sneaking out in the middle of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟一帮小屁孩猎杀怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go hunt monsters with the apple dumpling gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的孩子就这么找刺激吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what kids are doing for kicks these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那或许他知道  而且在帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Then maybe he knows, and he's helping her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后还被人拍了下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, get caught on "Candid camera"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快趁她惹出更多麻烦之前找到她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go find her before she gets into any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你25了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're 25?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  我想我40了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I think I'm 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你了  我有男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you... I have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你手机里怎么完全没有他的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how come I couldn't find him in your cellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  我们只视频聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we only skype.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.49,0:07:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我猜猜  他住在加拿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And let me guess -- he also lives in Canada?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还真是住在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he does, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个叫"给姐去死"的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small town called "Kiss my ass."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在车里的时候你可得跟我亲昵点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure were giving off a different vibe in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于回来了  开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. You're back. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼最后的影像来自取款机摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamp was last seen by an ATM camera 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正进入这间旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}checking into this hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我黑进了旅馆的摄像头找到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tapped into the hotel's security cams and found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,215房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room 215.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有信号吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You transmitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们搞一项新仪式怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how about we start a new tradition,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次干活儿之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and before each job, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:22.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们彼此赠吻  以祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}we give each other good-luck kisses?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改成我揍你的脖子怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about I punch you in the throat instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你那些小伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're not gonna get anywhere 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利希是不会买账的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Krissy with those cheesy moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能别再数落我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you stop putting salt in my game
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管好你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mind your own business?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Krissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这儿干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving your bacon, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我需要你救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it look like my bacon needs saving?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你们怎么找来的  我一直用现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. How'd you find me? I paid cash everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20英里内只有两个旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only two hotels within a 20-mile radius,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也付现金  但付的更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we paid cash, too -- just more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的招待员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaking clerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.85,0:09:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利希你爸爸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy, where's your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:10:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是再也别见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's do this again, like, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  我们能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And got what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.85,0:10:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们进去了  屋里安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in. The room's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody here but a vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:52.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-得叫辆救护车  -这就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to call an ambulance! - Ambulance is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她受惊了  我帮她安定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in shock. I'll stabilize her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她留给医务人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll leave her here for the paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你  别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Don't shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot me! Please, don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你  好疼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please... it hurts so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么快就把他放倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you drop him so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞镖里面是死人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darts filled with dead man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蓝货车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the blue van?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么蓝货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What blue van?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他之前冲着那辆蓝货车跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blue van that he was Usain Bolting it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他轮不到你来杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not your kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个月前这个吸血鬼潜入一户人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months ago, this blood banger snuck into a house
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死了三个正在熟睡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and killed three people in their sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.31,0:11:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! No! I didn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个女人  她从没伤害过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One was a woman -- never hurt anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外两个  是一个弟弟和一个妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other two, a brother and a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从朋友家回来  就发现了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came home from a friend's house, and I found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.44,0:12:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没做  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你  救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得私下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk to you privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识这家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  以前认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We have a past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你得跟我讲讲是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So, you're gonna have to catch me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What -- did your dad, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不能放弃那种生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't quit the life, could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一段时间我们过得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a while, it was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们每晚在桌前吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had dinner every night at a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们看电视  去散步  甚至去逛商场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We watched tv, went on walks. Even went to the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.39,0:13:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去追了来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the past came a-knockin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有天早上醒来就发现他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up one morning and found him dead....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的喉咙被割开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...his throat ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是约瑟芬和艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for Josephine and Aidan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:43.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定活不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how I would have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也失去了家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, they both lost their families, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我们在一起追杀吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the same vamps we're hunting together --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个血巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.01,0:13:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想给你浇冷水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, I am sorry to rain on your parade,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你太年轻了  不该干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are way too young to be doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀怪物没有太年轻一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never too young to kill monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是杀那个杀了你家人的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially the ones that kill your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔不总是杀戮和复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting isn't all about killing and revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上次不是谈过这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had this chat last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.73,0:14:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲戚什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any family that's still out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛辛那提有个姨妈  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}An aunt in Cincinnati. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得收拾东西  我们带你去那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're packing a bag, and we're taking you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看维克多是不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Victor's gonna have a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他收留了我们  教会我们一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took us in, showed us everything we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So, what are we talking here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少年猎魔班吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of kid's school for hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了  好吗  我们又不是X战警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be such a dweeb, okay? We're not the x-men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多在帮我们复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor's helping us get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管他是什么人  他不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I don't care what he is. He sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你和你的小伙伴被人发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you and your little crew here got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it wasn't for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的脸就会到处上新闻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your faces would be splattered all over the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, so what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许人们也该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time that people know the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上都有些什么恶魔在活动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what's really going bump in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引发恐慌  造成伤害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and cause panic? Create mayhem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用不着你来救  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't need you to save me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是个小孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a little kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小屁孩就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teenagers, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她跟你说维克多了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tell you about Victor? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说了  什么情况啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What do we think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在斯波坎市不是曾遇到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, didn't we meet up with a hunter named Victor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫维克多的猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}one time in Spokane?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那都是哪年的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那之后就没有他的音讯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't heard about him since.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么这些孩子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, these kids are --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身处危险  不知轻重  当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous and off their meds? Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么办  我们去找这个维克多谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? We go and talk with Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:15:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不像公社啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what I'd call a compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我想的不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just not what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.99,0:16:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像《蝇王》\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little more "Lord of the flies""
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是《考斯比一家》\N{\fnArial\fs30}less Huxtables.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多·罗杰斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们见过  在华盛顿猎杀食人怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met -- a rugaru hunt in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆  这是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam. This is Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:40.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. The Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.05,0:16:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好点了吗  -好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better now? - Much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do we always say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向前看  但永不遗忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move on, but never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你明早不是有三角学测试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now, don't you have a trig test in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  维克  没有测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm good, Vic. No test.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去冷静一下  打打游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna chill, play video games. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, keep dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都两次让你清理房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I asked you to clean your room twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:08.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you still haven't done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:12.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明早会把行动报告放在你桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full report about the hunt on your desk by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.99,0:17:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我回屋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll be in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些孩子还去上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, these kids go to school --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正常的那种学校吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, school-school, real school?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  而且他们表现很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and they're doing incredibly well
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其考虑到他们的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering all they've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你们怎么运作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so how does this work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先练练足球\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, after -- after soccer practice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者去卖面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and the bake sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后去砍掉吸血鬼的脑袋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}they, uh, chop vampires' heads off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为兼顾才是上策  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a balanced approach is best, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们还只是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就不该猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shouldn't be hunting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须立即停止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to break this up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到他们时  他们失落  不解和愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I found them, they were lost, confused, angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给了他们家庭和目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave them family and purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想打破这一切  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to take all that away? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样他们就不会死于非命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they don't get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道这行的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.01,0:18:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么要冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why take them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为下一代的猎人必须更强更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the next generation of hunters has to be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比什么更强更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.41,0:18:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你们的朋友  马丁是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your friends. I mean, Martin was insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思显然小时候被人头朝下摔过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somebody obviously dropped Garth on his head when he was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们很爱那个鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you two loved that Bobby guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他就是个没用的老酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was a barely functional alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说话小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No disrespect meant, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但约瑟芬是州代表运动员和全国优秀学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Josephine is an all-state athlete and national merit scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾丹能在瞬间把你的钱包顺走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aidan is so fast he could pick your pocket before you could even blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于克利希\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Krissy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是天生的领袖和猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, she's just a natural-born leader and hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些孩子是人中翘楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So these kids are the cream of the crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是披头士  是梦之队\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are the Beatles. They are the dream team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他们完成复仇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once they get their revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会成为我们可望而不可即的优秀猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}...they'll be better hunters than any of us ever dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  他们过得挺好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it? They got a pretty good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.69,0:19:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子不应该参与猎魔  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids aren't supposed to hunt, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当年就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  看看我们的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and look what that did for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们这么处理很得当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe they're doing it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们能一边猎魔一边好好生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they can hunt and have a real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  因为我们没做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? 'cause it didn't work for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为就没人做到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it doesn't work for anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多才不会收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause Victor's not gonna stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们说他们在找血巢对吧  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They said they were hunting a nest, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去替他们找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's hunt it for 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们想到办法对付维克多前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that way, until we can figure out what to do with Victor, 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.51,0:19:27.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能保他们平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}they stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么着手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your move?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟那个被绑在旅馆里的姑娘谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to that girl who was tied up at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得那事不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something didn't smell right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留下照顾这个脱线家族吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stay here and look after the Brady Bunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  来得正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.43,0:20:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-坐  -华夫饼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab a seat. - Waffles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  克利希的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Krissy's fav.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸以前总给我做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad used to make 'em for me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他就只会做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was the only thing he knew how to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interact.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意点礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you -- manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带好自己的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-放学我去接你们  -再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll pick you up after school. - See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快如闪电是吧  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whirlwind, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always like that with kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.35,0:21:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.10,0:21:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想造一两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want any?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  要孩子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, the answer's yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}These yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们去野营时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, until we went camping
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被一只雪怪撕成碎片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Wendigo ripped them to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.15,0:21:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才收留这些孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you're doing this, taking all these kids in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我意识到了什么吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what I realized, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些孩子不必走我们的老路\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that these kids,they don't have to live it the way we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总住在糟糕的旅馆  不停地奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, crappy hotel rooms, always moving,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有家人  也没有自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}no family, no life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不非得那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和警察都说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told the cops already,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道吉米·戴为什么会做那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure why Jimmy Day would do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米·戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识绑架你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so you knew the guy that grabbed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇上的人都认识吉米  他是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in town knows Jimmy, he's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从阿富汗回来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a parade for him 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在市区为他举行了游行庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}downtown when he came back from Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  那是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sorry. When was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.57,0:22:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个叫吉米·戴的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh... this Jimmy Day guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就那么抓了你  把你带去了旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}he...he just grabbed you and took you to the hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我下班回家走到停车场时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I came from work and was in the parking lot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有辆蓝货车停了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}when this blue van pulled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.43,0:22:26.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个穿连帽衫的人向我问路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy with a hoodie asked me directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就记得这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就醒来发现自己被绑在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}till I woke up tied to that bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿连帽衫的人也在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And was hoodie there, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有吉米在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Jimmy, 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哭  还说对不起之类的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was crying, saying he was sorry and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he was sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始我以为他要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first I thought he was gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但后来  他显得很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he just... he just seemed scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.91,0:23:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. What happened to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多把我们叫回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor pulled us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们又找到了一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause we've found another target.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀害克利希父亲的那个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vamp that killed Krissy's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.40,0:23:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.37,0:23:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在附近加油站的摄像头里发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled this from a security camera at a nearby gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  我们怎么确定就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, how do we know this is definitely her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.23,0:23:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警方的素描  受害者的叙述\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police sketch, victim's accounts...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.51,0:23:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲的项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈在结婚纪念日给他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom gave it to him on their anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.10,0:23:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定这是摄像头拍到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is a video surveillance pic?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.35,0:24:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.38,0:24:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.48,0:24:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那女孩谈得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. How did it go with the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.45,0:24:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪  也许那个吸血鬼没有说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange. Might be that vampire wasn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是近一个月刚转化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was fresh made within the month,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.11,0:24:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但约瑟芬的家人是三个月前被杀害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Josephine's family was murdered three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.52,0:24:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那谁杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who killed them, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想找那个开蓝货车的人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to talk to whoever's driving that blue van.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除此之外  你那边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than that...you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.93,0:24:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.81,0:24:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多声称他拿到了一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor says he has a surveillance photo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀害克利希家人的吸血鬼的监控图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the vampire that killed Krissy's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是迪恩  我觉得不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean... I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.36,0:24:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那上面没有时间水印\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time stamp on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.14,0:24:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你觉得他在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So you think he's lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.72,0:24:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他只是弄错了  很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that, or he's just wrong. It's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.07,0:24:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从不信任穿毛衣的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I never trust a guy who wears a sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.39,0:24:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to head back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.69,0:24:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  我一人可以  我再做一些调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm good. Let me do some more digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.75,0:24:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我去找旅馆招待员谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm gonna talk to the hotel clerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.17,0:24:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看他知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.43,0:25:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追踪那个吸血鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking that vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.03,0:25:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一个离家更近的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we got a problem a lot closer to home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.79,0:25:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.03,0:25:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到那蓝货车了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that blue van?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.85,0:25:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥昨天在旅馆外面看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother saw it outside the hotel yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.58,0:25:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为他和那吸血鬼是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think he's working with the vampire we popped.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.22,0:25:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们有事干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're going huntin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh. Nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet. Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.17,0:25:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道昨天是谁住进了215房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know who, uh, checked into room 215 yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.07,0:25:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个穿连帽衫的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was some guy wearing a hoodie,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.59,0:25:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难辨认出他的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it was hard to make out his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.20,0:25:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是不是开一辆蓝货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drive a blue van, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.95,0:25:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来像停车员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a valet?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.70,0:25:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他拿了一个宣传册\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.00,0:25:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面有"旅馆"的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that says "Lodg"" On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.95,0:26:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"康威泉旅馆"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Conway springs lodge."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.87,0:26:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  夏季时很火爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, big during the summer season.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.94,0:26:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每年这个时候歇业\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this time of year, it's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.54,0:26:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这儿到那里有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far away is it from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.85,0:26:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概有几英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a couple miles down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.05,0:27:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.20,0:27:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please make it go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.51,0:27:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.67,0:27:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.02,0:27:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  把灯关上  太亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, shut them off! They're too bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.90,0:27:48.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先告诉我是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till you tell me what the hell's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.31,0:27:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.91,0:27:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.24,0:27:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前从没发生过这种情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's never happened to you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:27:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  没有  我有些不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, there's something wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.54,0:28:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人  他对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That -- that guy, he did something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哪个人  -我不认识  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- What guy? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.81,0:28:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个开蓝货车的人  他掳走我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy in a blue van, he -- he grabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.06,0:28:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.29,0:28:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.95,0:28:10.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.75,0:28:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.05,0:29:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下  我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put those away, and we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.59,0:29:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么和杀死我爸的吸血鬼在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you with the vampire that killed my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.29,0:29:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're barking up the wrong tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.32,0:29:32.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是杀你爸的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't kill your pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.99,0:29:35.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤害你  迪恩  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt you, Dean, 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.91,0:29:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不走开我不会手软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I will if you don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.09,0:29:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  克利希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Krissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.61,0:29:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how would you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.71,0:29:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她是新转化的  只有一两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she's fresh made, a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.37,0:29:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她爸爸死于几个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her dad was killed months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.07,0:29:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.40,0:30:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚我们杀死的那个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That vamp that we killed last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.11,0:30:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么发誓他没做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was he swearing that he didn't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.66,0:30:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he was a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.68,0:30:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼不会求饶  他们只进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires don't beg for their lives. They attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最后一次客气地说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, last time I'm gonna ask you nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.12,0:30:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下  否则有人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the damn guns off me, or somebody's gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.83,0:30:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吹牛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.92,0:30:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.96,0:30:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算她不是杀死我爸爸的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's say this isn't the vamp who killed my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.14,0:30:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她仍然是个恶魔  理应受死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still a monster and deserves to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.09,0:30:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能救她就不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we can save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.73,0:30:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.48,0:30:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还没有吸血\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't fed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能逆转化  只需给她喝下转化者的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can reverse this if we find her maker and get his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.29,0:30:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要在乎她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why should we care about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.17,0:30:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过  猎魔不总是杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, hunting isn't always about killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.61,0:30:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.91,0:30:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去跟别人说吧  我们才不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preach to some other choir. We're not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.88,0:30:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想杀死无辜的女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to kill an innocent girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.65,0:30:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让杀死我爸爸的吸血鬼以命抵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the blood sucker who killed my dad to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.62,0:30:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会查出凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna find out who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但别残忍到随便杀个人解恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's not be so bloodthirsty that just anyone will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但维克多说凶手就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Victor says it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.94,0:31:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我说不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say it ain't!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把她带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna pack her to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.88,0:31:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找维克多当面对质\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna ask Victor ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.14,0:31:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.67,0:31:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awake. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.10,0:31:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.62,0:31:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.39,0:31:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picture this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们凯旋归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids arrive home victorious,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.38,0:31:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却发现你死在客厅里\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to find you dead in their living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.10,0:31:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似他们猎杀的血巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that nest of vampires they were hunting
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.32,0:31:50.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来复仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}were seeking revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.53,0:31:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.73,0:32:00.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就激励他们继续猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, inspiring them to hunt even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.47,0:32:02.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.36,0:32:04.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让任何人毒害我孩子的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have anyone poisoning my kids' minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.30,0:32:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  除了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than yourself, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.41,0:32:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不必向你和你那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to justify my actions to you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.54,0:32:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自以为是的哥哥解释我的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}or your self-righteous ass of a brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.95,0:32:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指你和吸血鬼合作的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like why you're working with a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.29,0:32:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对他有什么好处  可以肆意游荡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's he get out of this? Free roaming rights?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.19,0:32:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在打仗  一场要输了的仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at war -- a war that we are losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.86,0:32:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦一事的惨败就是一记警钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leviathan fiasco was a wake-up call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.52,0:32:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了活下去  我们得无所不用其极\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do what we can to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.15,0:32:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不指望你会理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wouldn't expect you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.41,0:32:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是一个父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.74,0:32:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what it's like
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.13,0:32:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到孩子濒死的哭喊是什么滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hear the cries of your children dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.69,0:32:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我有机会改过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I have a second chance to make it all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.30,0:33:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有机会创造下一代猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create the next generation of hunters --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.19,0:33:04.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们更强  更快  更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger, faster, smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.60,0:33:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.20,0:33:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.57,0:33:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两个人不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two are not to be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.13,0:33:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要毁掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.95,0:33:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识这个吸血鬼吗  维克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know this vamp, Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.62,0:33:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他当然认识  他们俩是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he does! They're working together!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.36,0:33:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.46,0:33:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.42,0:33:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  一点不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.09,0:33:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个开蓝货车的一直在制造新吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, blue van here's been turning fresh vamps
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.40,0:33:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后制造机会让你们轻松杀死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and setting them up for you kids as easy kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.24,0:33:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.17,0:33:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们根本没杀我们的家人  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they didn't kill our families, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.48,0:34:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.89,0:34:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.28,0:34:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.15,0:34:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都哭喊过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they all screamed...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.95,0:34:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求我饶命  尤其是那些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and begged for mercy, especially the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  塞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough, Seth!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.79,0:34:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们必须理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.00,0:34:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有办法让未来更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a way to make the future better.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.19,0:34:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了那个美好未来  我必须下狠手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to get there, I had to do something hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.72,0:34:27.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你指使他杀了我们的亲人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed them off your orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.55,0:34:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们需要动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.67,0:34:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我考察过你们每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I scouted each and every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.63,0:34:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道只有这样  你们才会走这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And knew it was the only way to get you to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.48,0:34:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就杀了我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed our families?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.76,0:34:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们的死很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the deaths are tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.79,0:34:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但想想你们强强联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But think of all the future lives
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将来能拯救多少生命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will now be saved because you are now together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.15,0:34:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些假吸血鬼只是你的训练手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, these fake vampires were just a way for you to train us
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.27,0:34:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我们灌输谎言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fill our heads with lies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.53,0:34:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这比我们所有人都重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bigger than all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.00,0:35:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要以大局为重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to learn to put things in perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.91,0:35:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.36,0:35:08.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以不计前嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get past this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.72,0:35:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.89,0:35:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aidan!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.07,0:35:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.35,0:35:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.24,0:35:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的一切都是我教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taught you everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.13,0:35:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不都是你教的  维克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.35,0:35:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利希  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.54,0:35:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们想为家人复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we want revenge for our families' deaths,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.63,0:35:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得拿他下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}he gives it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.52,0:36:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.40,0:36:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不能杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.50,0:36:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是人  他是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a person. He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.24,0:36:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利希  不管我们怎么做  都不会有好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy, this ends bad, no matter what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.93,0:36:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.32,0:36:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利希  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.67,0:36:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这枪是为我爸爸还你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.19,0:36:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为约瑟芬一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Josephine's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.62,0:36:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Aidan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.01,0:36:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.70,0:36:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就让他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're just gonna let him live?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.50,0:36:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.12,0:36:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他孤独一人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All alone, with himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.71,0:36:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有家人  没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No family. No friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看这就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me, that's not much of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.16,0:37:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去救那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's save that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.79,0:37:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.12,0:37:38.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drink slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.73,0:37:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这能帮你消除疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will take away all the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.98,0:37:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁我没打你赶紧闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, before I punch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.05,0:37:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.68,0:37:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.31,0:38:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这个是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.87,0:38:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去外面等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.02,0:38:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.76,0:38:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在车里  你准备好了就出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you're ready, we'll be in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.88,0:38:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.52,0:38:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你姨妈  辛辛那提  普通的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your aunt? Cincinnati? Normal life?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.37,0:38:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明天午饭时就能到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be there by lunch tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.62,0:38:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我们因为阴谋和惨剧相识  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I hate how we were put together, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.65,0:38:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能否认这感觉很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't deny that it feels right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.97,0:38:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要让维克多把这也毁了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why should I let Victor ruin that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.54,0:38:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what you're saying is that
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.37,0:38:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢那边那个男孩  你想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you like that boy over there and you want to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.86,0:38:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  艾丹  才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Aidan? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.10,0:38:46.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说他就像我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean... he's like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.98,0:38:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不是你说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.62,0:38:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还是未成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're all still minors.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.06,0:38:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.18,0:38:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约瑟芬还有几个月就满18岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josephine will be 18 in a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.30,0:38:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里有一份生活  也有彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we all have a life and each other here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.92,0:39:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.46,0:39:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会主动去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't go looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.47,0:39:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果附近出现了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if any monsters show up around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.38,0:39:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们最好小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}they better look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.59,0:39:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.81,0:39:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.27,0:39:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我还需要跟你费一番口舌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was gonna have to fight you way more on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  你不是小孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're right. You're not a kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.39,0:39:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以自己做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make your own decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.62,0:39:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个老古董你还不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right for an old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.08,0:39:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真没那么老呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really not that old.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.24,0:39:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对着镜子说去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.63,0:39:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  我会找...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, I'm gonna have a, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.27,0:39:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找人每隔一阵子就过来看看你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}a guy come and check on you every once in a while, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.43,0:39:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.65,0:39:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会来确认你们平安  缺不缺什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll make sure that you're all right and you got what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.25,0:39:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-盖思  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Garth? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.82,0:39:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始会觉得他怪  但慢慢会喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little strange at first, but you'll come to love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.22,0:39:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.45,0:40:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  再见  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Goodbye, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.43,0:40:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aidan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.01,0:40:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  有些...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, there's, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.96,0:40:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些关于克利希的事我想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}something I want to tell you about Krissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.38,0:40:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.09,0:40:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我伤害她你会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill me if I ever hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.12,0:40:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah. Blah. Blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.03,0:40:16.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  她会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No. She'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.61,0:40:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.91,0:40:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.09,0:40:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.97,0:40:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本可能更糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have been a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.17,0:40:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不尽快关上地狱之门就会更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will be if we don't shut those gates of hell soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.79,0:40:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟这事有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they have to do with any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.91,0:40:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在是猎人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.36,0:40:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎人是没有回头路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't just walk away from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.94,0:40:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一条出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way out of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.04,0:40:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你我都知道这路不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you and I both know it ain't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.02,0:40:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们会不一样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they'll be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.01,0:40:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们能永远关闭地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe if we shut that hell hole once and for and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.81,0:40:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们三个就能有自己的生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those three can have a real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.64,0:41:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许不止他们可以有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they won't be the only ones.
